r:scale-105 hover:bg-[#078c6d] focus:outline-none\"\n          style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px;\"\n        >\n          <img src=\"https://www.freeiconspng.com/uploads/cart-icon-16.png\" alt=\"Carrito\" class=\"w-6 h-6\">\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
